  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUsing the same prime \u003ci\u003ep\u003c/i\u003e you chose in part \u003cb\u003ea\u003c/b\u003e, repeat the process with some different values of \u003ci\u003ea\u003c/i\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat pattern do you notice? Make a conjecture.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTry \u003ci\u003ea\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 2.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eLet \u003ci\u003ea\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 2.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThen \u003ci\u003ea\u003csup\u003ep\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 2\u003csup\u003e7\u003c/sup\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eKey in \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17246\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17247\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qcap.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17247\u0026quot;,113)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17248\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q7.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17249\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17249\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator gives\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e2\u003csup\u003e7\u003c/sup\u003e \u003d 128.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-1 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_3_1_numbertheory_8b_20/f-20-8b-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eUse the \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17250\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qintdiv.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17250\u0026quot;,163)\"\u003e key.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eWe have to divide 128 by 7, and find the remainder.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eUse the \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17251\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qintdiv.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17251\u0026quot;,163)\"\u003e key to divide with remainders.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eKey in \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17252\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17253\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17254\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q8.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17255\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17256\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qintdiv.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17256\u0026quot;,163)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17257\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q7.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17258\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17258\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator gives the answer as 18 r 2.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSo, the remainder for \u003ci\u003ea\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 2 is \u003cb\u003e2\u003c/b\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_3_1_numbertheory_8b_20/f-20-8b-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTry \u003ci\u003ea\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 3.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFor \u003ci\u003ea\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 3, following the calculator steps shown, we get remainder \u003cb\u003e3\u003c/b\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_3_1_numbertheory_8b_20/f-20-8b-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTry \u003ci\u003ea\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 5.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFor \u003ci\u003ea\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 5, following the calculator steps shown, we get remainder \u003cb\u003e5\u003c/b\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-7 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_3_1_numbertheory_8b_20/f-20-8b-4.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTry \u003ci\u003ea\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 6.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFor \u003ci\u003ea\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 6, following the calculator steps shown, we get remainder \u003cb\u003e6\u003c/b\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-9 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_3_1_numbertheory_8b_20/f-20-8b-5.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eExplain the pattern.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eIt appears that \u003ci\u003ea\u003c/i\u003e\u003csup\u003e7\u003c/sup\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17259\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/divide.gif\"\u003e 7 always gives remainder \u003ci\u003ea\u003c/i\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    }
  ]
